{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-the-sterling","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"the-sterling-omniyat-business-bay","about":"The Sterling - a unique project by developer Omniyat, located in the heart of Dubai. This project is an elegant, modern and prestigious collection of apartments that offers its residents luxury, comfort and coziness.One of the main features of the project is its elegant design, which is perfectly blended with modern elements and technology. Amazing architecture gives the buildings a unique character, and carefully thought-out planning design provides spacious and functional interior spaces.Residents of the complex have access to a host of first-class amenities and public areas. Inside the complex, there is a fully equipped fitness center, a luxurious spa, a rooftop pool with city views, walking paths, manicured gardens and more. Residents will also be able to enjoy magnificent views of the city from panoramic windows or simply relax on spacious terraces.One of the main advantages of the complex is its prime location in close proximity to the main highway Sheikh Zayed Road. The Sterling is in close proximity to various cultural and commercial centers such as shopping malls, restaurants, museums and amusement parks. This creates an excellent environment for working, entertaining and living the high life.","price":1867760,"title":"The Sterling","bitrix":{"id":467,"pf_id":"are.2.623","source":null,"project_id":"The Sterling","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Sterling","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Omniyat","project_location":"Business Bay"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/13/images/2023/12/17/340x252/vbowEKTFFUIxJFjV7WH5SJtERkIoAMlgvYJnsllN.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/13/images/2023/12/17/464x312/vbowEKTFFUIxJFjV7WH5SJtERkIoAMlgvYJnsllN.webp"}],"status":"read